        "inner_text": "BACCABUCCI offers a range of special crafted pairs that comes in a strong designed top-bottom hard cover Korean craft boxes, with shoes wrapped in butter paper. While, the accessories are delivered in a beautifully laser designed Wooden handcrafted boxes. The box contains a care card, which gives you instructions on how to care for your accessories, along with a warranty card. It’s nothing short of luxury! We will be soon introducing an option to add a greeting card in the box too. Watch out for the greeting box, where you can fill in details, on the check out page.",
